The data files in this directory (graph.edg, labels.jsonl, continents.txt) are derived from the OpenFlights airport and route databases
(https://openflights.org/data.php, 2014 snapshot of https://github.com/jpatokal/openflights).

They are made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0,
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Any rights in individual contents of
the database are licensed under the Database Contents License (DbCL) v1.0,
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/.
